<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4efe7">
  <meta name="description" content="Monteiro Construções, Reformas, Carpintaria e Telhados em Belo Horizonte e região.">
  <title>Monteiro | Construções, Reformas, Carpintaria &amp; Telhados</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --paper: #f5f1eb;
      --white: #fffdfa;
      --ink: #302f2b;
      --muted: #706b65;
      --wood: #a85d32;
      --wood-light: #d7b79e;
      --wood-dark: #203c57;
      --green: #526d7d;
      --line: #ded8d0;
      --gold: #efd9c8;
      --content: 1100px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 85px; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 16px/1.65 "Trebuchet MS", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img, svg { display: block; }

    .wrap {
      width: min(var(--content), 90%);
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .header {
      position: sticky;
      z-index: 5;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(245, 241, 235, .96);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .nav {
      min-height: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--wood-dark);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .brand-mark { width: 54px; height: 54px; flex: 0 0 54px; }

    .brand-copy { display: grid; line-height: 1.05; }
    .brand-name {
      color: #17314b;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .06em;
    }

    .brand-tagline {
      margin-top: 5px;
      color: #31475b;
      font-size: .54rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .045em;
      line-height: 1.35;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 26px;
      font-size: .92rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--wood); }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 48px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--wood);
      color: var(--white);
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
    }

    .button:hover { background: var(--wood-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #506a7b, #354f65);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .hero::after {
      position: absolute;
      inset: -30% auto -30% -45%;
      width: 30%;
      content: "";
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #ffffff12, transparent);
      transform: rotate(18deg);
      animation: sheen 9s ease-in-out infinite;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      min-height: 520px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 42px;
      padding-block: 70px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }

    h1 {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
      line-height: 1.04;
    }

    .hero-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 20px 0 26px;
      color: #f2f3f1;
      font-size: 1.07rem;
    }

    .hero .button { background: var(--gold); color: var(--wood-dark); }
    .hero .button:hover { background: #f0d39b; }

    .roof-art {
      width: min(440px, 100%);
      margin-inline: auto;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 22px 18px #122a2855);
      animation: bob 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    section { padding-block: 72px; }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 34px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section-heading .eyebrow { color: var(--wood); }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
      line-height: 1.12;
    }

    .section-heading p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

    .services {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .service {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 190px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 7px 20px rgba(32, 60, 87, .06);
      transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease, border-color .22s ease;
    }

    .service:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: #c9a48d;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 26px rgba(32, 60, 87, .12);
    }

    .service-icon {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }

    .service h3, .project h3, .wood h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--wood-dark);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .service p, .project p, .wood p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .94rem;
    }

    .woods-section { background: #eae4dc; }

    .woods {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .wood {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .wood-grain {
      height: 92px;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(3deg, transparent 0 12px, #4a2d191c 13px, transparent 15px),
        linear-gradient(110deg, #9d6943, #d2ae7b 48%, #93603a);
    }

    .wood:nth-child(2) .wood-grain {
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(2deg, transparent 0 8px, #24130924 9px, transparent 11px),
        linear-gradient(95deg, #673621, #995a37, #703b26);
    }

    .wood:nth-child(3) .wood-grain {
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(178deg, transparent 0 11px, #482b111c 12px, transparent 14px),
        linear-gradient(100deg, #ae823e, #d8b875, #a98143);
    }

    .wood-copy { padding: 18px; }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .project {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .project-art {
      min-height: 165px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #dfc7b5, #a85d32);
    }

    .project-art svg { width: 75%; max-width: 220px; }
    .project:nth-child(2) .project-art { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #d2dfe0, #637f8d); }
    .project:nth-child(3) .project-art { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #eee0d4, #ae8068); }
    .project-copy { padding: 17px; }

    .gallery-note {
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .85rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact {
      padding: 42px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); }
    .contact h2 { color: var(--white); }
    .contact p { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 22px; color: #e6e9df; }
    .contact .button { background: var(--gold); color: var(--wood-dark); }

    .footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 24px 0 90px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .88rem;
    }

    .footer p { margin: 0; }

    .footer-email {
      color: var(--wood-dark);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .footer-email:hover { color: var(--wood); }

    .footer-email:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--wood);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .whatsapp {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 10;
      right: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #39745c;
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px #0003;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .whatsapp:hover { background: #2b604a; transform: translateY(-2px); }

    @keyframes bob {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    }

    @keyframes sheen {
      0%, 35% { left: -45%; }
      75%, 100% { left: 135%; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .nav { min-height: 70px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-block: 12px; }
      .nav-links { gap: 14px; font-size: .85rem; }
      .nav-links .nav-contact { display: none; }
      .hero-inner { min-height: auto; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-block: 56px; }
      .roof-art { width: min(330px, 85%); }
      .services, .woods, .gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .service { min-height: auto; }
      section { padding-block: 54px; }
      .contact { padding: 30px 20px; }
      .footer { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding-bottom: 90px; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: .01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: .01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="header">
    <div class="wrap nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Monteiro Construções, Reformas, Carpintaria e Telhados, início">
        <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-label="Símbolo vetorial de telhado e carpintaria">
          <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="29" fill="#f8f4ec" stroke="#a9a39a" stroke-width="2"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24.5" fill="none" stroke="#d3c8b7" stroke-width="1"/>
          <path d="M17 31 31 19l14 12" fill="none" stroke="#203c57" stroke-width="2.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M21 29v15h20V29M27 44V34l8-6v16" fill="none" stroke="#203c57" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="m31 24 5-4v8" fill="none" stroke="#a85d32" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M28 34h5m-5 4h5" stroke="#a85d32" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="brand-copy">
          <span class="brand-name">MONTEIRO</span>
          <span class="brand-tagline">Construções · Reformas<br>Carpintaria &amp; Telhados</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Menu principal">
        <a href="#servicos">Serviços</a>
        <a href="#madeiras">Madeiras</a>
        <a href="#galeria">Galeria</a>
        <a class="button nav-contact" href="#contato">Contato</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Telhados e estruturas · Belo Horizonte e região</p>
          <h1>Estrutura segura. Acabamento que valoriza.</h1>
          <p>Construção, reforma e manutenção de telhados com atenção ao seu projeto, escolha cuidadosa de materiais e atendimento direto.</p>
        </div>
        <svg class="roof-art" viewBox="0 0 440 330" role="img" aria-label="Ilustração de uma casa com telhado e martelo">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="roof" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
              <stop stop-color="#e0bf8a"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9c6941"/>
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="wall" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
              <stop stop-color="#f2e5ce"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#c5a77d"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <path d="M55 152 220 35l165 117v137H55V152Z" fill="url(#wall)" stroke="#39281e" stroke-width="8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="m31 158 189-137 189 137-24 23L220 71 55 181l-24-23Z" fill="url(#roof)" stroke="#39281e" stroke-width="8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M182 289v-91h76v91" fill="#765037" stroke="#39281e" stroke-width="7"/>
          <path d="M84 190h63v52H84zM293 190h63v52h-63z" fill="#6c9690" stroke="#39281e" stroke-width="7"/>
          <path d="M114 190v52m-30-26h63m177-26v52m-31-26h63" stroke="#39281e" stroke-width="5"/>
          <g transform="translate(316 28) rotate(22)">
            <rect x="22" y="7" width="13" height="92" rx="6" fill="#62432d"/>
            <path d="M2 5h53v20H2c-7 0-10-4-10-10S-5 5 2 5Z" fill="#e2bd78" stroke="#39281e" stroke-width="5"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="servicos">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Como podemos ajudar</p>
          <h2>Serviços para sua cobertura</h2>
          <p>Atendimento simples e direto, do primeiro contato à execução do serviço.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services">
          <article class="service">
            <div class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</div>
            <h3>Construção de telhados</h3>
            <p>Estruturas em madeira e coberturas planejadas para as necessidades da obra.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service">
            <div class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔨</div>
            <h3>Reforma e manutenção</h3>
            <p>Reparos e melhorias para manter telhados seguros e funcionais.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service">
            <div class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">▱</div>
            <h3>Instalação de coberturas</h3>
            <p>Instalação e acabamento conforme o tipo de imóvel e projeto.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="woods-section" id="madeiras">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Materiais</p>
          <h2>Madeira com escolha consciente</h2>
          <p>A espécie, o tratamento e o dimensionamento devem ser avaliados para cada estrutura.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="woods">
          <article class="wood">
            <div class="wood-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wood-copy"><h3>Eucalipto tratado</h3><p>Opção comum em estruturas; confirme tratamento e procedência com o fornecedor.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="wood">
            <div class="wood-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wood-copy"><h3>Paraju / Aparaju</h3><p>Verifique espécie, origem e características do lote antes de especificar.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="wood">
            <div class="wood-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wood-copy"><h3>Angelim</h3><p>A indicação depende da espécie identificada e do dimensionamento da estrutura.</p></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="galeria">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Referências</p>
          <h2>Inspiração para o seu projeto</h2>
          <p>Ilustrações demonstrativas que podem ser trocadas por fotos reais dos serviços.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery">
          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-art" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 220 130" fill="none"><path d="m20 70 90-56 90 56v48H20V70Z" fill="#e8d8bd" stroke="#493522" stroke-width="6"/><path d="m9 72 101-64 101 64-12 13-89-55-89 55L9 72Z" fill="#725038"/><rect x="91" y="75" width="38" height="43" fill="#805437"/><rect x="39" y="79" width="31" height="26" fill="#7fa29a"/><rect x="150" y="79" width="31" height="26" fill="#7fa29a"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="project-copy"><h3>Telhado residencial</h3><p>Exemplo ilustrativo de cobertura para residência.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-art" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 220 130" fill="none"><path d="m22 69 88-56 88 56v51H22V69Z" fill="#e2d5bd" stroke="#40362b" stroke-width="6"/><path d="m10 72 100-64 100 64-12 13-88-56-88 56L10 72Z" fill="#294b42"/><path d="M48 77v41m31-59v59m31-78v78m31-59v59m31-41v41" stroke="#a97749" stroke-width="7"/><path d="M30 118h160" stroke="#40362b" stroke-width="7"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="project-copy"><h3>Estrutura em madeira</h3><p>Referência visual de estrutura e acabamento.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-art" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 220 130" fill="none"><path d="m20 69 90-57 90 57v50H20V69Z" fill="#e8dcc8" stroke="#493522" stroke-width="6"/><path d="m8 72 102-65 102 65-13 13-89-57-89 57L8 72Z" fill="#a16b42"/><path d="M50 86h120M50 99h120M50 112h120" stroke="#744c31" stroke-width="5"/><rect x="92" y="78" width="36" height="41" fill="#536f68"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="project-copy"><h3>Reforma de cobertura</h3><p>Ideia de renovação para diferentes imóveis.</p></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contato">
      <div class="wrap contact">
        <p class="eyebrow">Atendimento em Belo Horizonte e região</p>
        <h2>Vamos conversar sobre sua obra?</h2>
        <p>Use o botão flutuante do WhatsApp para falar diretamente com a Monteiro.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="wrap footer">
    <p>© 2026 Monteiro · Construções, Reformas, Carpintaria &amp; Telhados · Belo Horizonte, MG</p>
    <a class="footer-email" href="mailto:cnap9988@gmail.com?subject=D%C3%BAvida%20sobre%20os%20servi%C3%A7os">Dúvidas? cnap9988@gmail.com</a>
  </footer>

  <a class="whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/5531989065898?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20Monteiro!%20Gostaria%20de%20conversar%20sobre%20um%20servi%C3%A7o." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Abrir conversa com Monteiro pelo WhatsApp">
    <span aria-hidden="true">☏</span> WhatsApp
  </a>
</body>
</html>
